Make the IP family of every Service the operator creates for pulp-api, pulp-content, the database, and otel (SingleStack/PreferDualStack/RequireDualStack, IPv4/IPv6/dual-stack) configurable via two new Pulp CR fields, `ip_family_policy` and `ip_families`, mirroring `corev1.ServiceSpec`'s own fields exactly. Defaults (unset) are unchanged from today's hardcoded SingleStack/IPv4 behavior.
